      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:shabbat/conclusion/havdalah">
        <tei:head xml:lang="en">Havdalah</tei:head>
        <tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">The <tei:hi rend="italic">Havdalah</tei:hi> service, with which we conclude the observance of Shabbos was ordained by the Men of the Great Assembly who flourished through the beginning of the Second Temple period.</tei:note>
        <tei:note type="instruction" xml:lang="en">You hold the wine cup in your right hand until after the blessing on the wine, then transfer the cup to your left hand and hold the spice box in your right for the blessing on the spices. Then set the spice box aside, return the wine cup to your right hand, and pronounce the blessing on the fire. After the blessing, set the wine cup down and look at your fingernails in the light of the candles. Afterwards take the wine cup in your right hand until you complete <tei:hi rend="italic">Havdalah.</tei:hi></tei:note>
        <j:transclude type="external" target="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hinneh_el_yeshuati"/>
